{"ID":"20240206101200-qqf0ujp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206101200-qqf0ujp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101200-qqf0ujp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101210-abzc6p7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101204-kp3m9cf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101210-abzc6p7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:161,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:161\u0026#125;","title":"罗汉果","type":"doc","updated":"20240902145737"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101210-abzc6p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101210-abzc6p7","updated":"20240206101211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于广西桂林市永福县等地。\n【性状】\t卵形、椭圆形或球形。表面褐色、黄褐色或绿褐色、有深色斑块和黄色柔毛，有的具611条纵纹。顶端有花柱残痕。基部有果梗痕。体轻，质脆，果皮薄、易破。果瓤 (中、内果皮) 海绵状，浅棕色。种子扁圆形，多数、浅红色至棕红色，两面中间微四陷。四周有放射状沟纹，边缘有槽。气微，味甜。\n【性味】\t甘，凉。\n【功效】\t清热润肺，利咽开音，润肠通便。用于肺热操咳，咽痛失音，肠燥便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101204-kp3m9cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101204-kp3m9cf","updated":"20240206101204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101204-cvc5t0s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723100811-y9rtjik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723100811-y9rtjik","updated":"20240723100811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"罗汉果 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/罗汉果 5-20240723100811-1qrzrsv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723100937-7braww0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723100937-7braww0","updated":"20240723100937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"罗汉果 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/罗汉果 6-20240723100937-bbc91b1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723100138-ya028jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723100138-ya028jn","updated":"20240723100214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"罗汉果"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/罗汉果-20240723100138-mzwoinw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 352px;","style":"width: 342px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"罗汉果 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/罗汉果 2-20240723100214-czb5ggt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 342px;\" parent-style=\"width: 352px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902145537-wr5zt73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145537-wr5zt73","updated":"20240902145537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-